  "description": "[Pre-serialization](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/saranghaetang)  \n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/saranghaetang_en)\n\nMeet Minwoo, an aspiring webcomic artist who's struggling with his newfound independence. He has to prove to his parents that his doodling career is more than just a hobby, or else they'll force him to follow the path that they've planned out for him. Stretching every dollar and every meal, he soon becomes a regular at a convenience store nearby. But despite his dire situation, his encounter with the cashier seems to be a gateway for romance...  \n*(Lezhin Serial Version)*  \n~\nPark Minwoo is an aspiring webtoon artist who's struggling with his newfound independence. He has to save up enough money or else his parents are making him follow the life that they've planned out for him. Minwoo quickly becomes a regular at a convenience store nearby, and despite his dire situation, his encounter with the cashier seems to be a gateway for romance... Or is it?  \n*(2020 Lezhin Comic Challenge Version)*",
